data=col3,Combat
data=col5,1,All Slayer assignments are treated as using a Slayer VIP Ticket.
data=col5,1,50% increased Slayer experience.
data=col5,1,Increased chance of rare drops and enhanced ring of wealth.
data=col5,1,Charm drops give one more charm than normal.
data=col5,1,Shattered Worlds grants 50% extra anima.
