data=col2,22nd-25th December:
data=col3,Skilling - Gathering & Support
data=col5,1,Divination: Springs last for twice as long once a wisp is activated.
data=col5,1,Divination: Enriched divination nodes spawn every 10 minutes.
data=col5,1,Fishing: Spots move around half as frequently as before.
data=col5,1,Thieving: Pharaoh's Sceptre and Black Ibis outfit drops are twice as likely at Pyramid Plunder.
data=col5,1,Dungeoneering: Double tokens from regular Dungeoneering.
data=col5,1,Dungeoneering: No experience penalty upon death.
data=col5,1,Hunter: 2 Orokami spawn instead of 1 on uncharted isles.
data=col5,1,Agility: Higher chance of activating The Pit Minigame.
data=col5,1,Mining nodes and trees replenish twice as quickly.
data=col5,1,10% chance not to deplete uncharted isles resources while harvesting.
data=col6,5777
data=col7,5780

